{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Echoes of Elpis</i></strong> is a high-octane <strong><i>twin-stick shooter</i></strong> set aboard the colossal starship Elpis. Carve a path through relentless enemies as you fight deeper into its steel corridors, pushing ever further into a vessel that refuses to give up its secrets easily. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884720/extras/e031e492a13b4c73ab97f4d657fea3d5.poster.avif?t=1773039865\" width=640 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884720/extras/e031e492a13b4c73ab97f4d657fea3d5.webm?t=1773039865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884720/extras/e031e492a13b4c73ab97f4d657fea3d5.mp4?t=1773039865\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each room holds the promise of discovery. Unearth rare technology and long-lost artifacts scattered throughout the ship. These powerful finds <strong><i>reshape the way you fight</i></strong>, unlocking new abilities and turning the tide as you bend Elpis\u2019s own defenses to your will. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884720/extras/84efbd9764a772f1653a5d9bb777b4de.poster.avif?t=1773039865\" width=640 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884720/extras/84efbd9764a772f1653a5d9bb777b4de.webm?t=1773039865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884720/extras/84efbd9764a772f1653a5d9bb777b4de.mp4?t=1773039865\" 